{"seq":4,"slug":"filter-and-rewrite","title":"历史重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/filter-and-rewrite","wordCount":836,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"历史重写\">历史重写</h1><h2 id=\"为什么需要重写历史\">为什么需要重写历史</h2><p>当仓库中不慎提交了<strong>敏感数据（Sensitive Data）</strong>（API 密钥、密码、证书）或<strong>大文件</strong>（二进制包、数据集），这些内容会永久存在于 Git 历史中，即使后续删除也不安全。仅靠 <code>git rm</code> 只能从当前版本移除文件，历史提交中的数据仍然可以被恢复。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>提交了 API 密钥</td>\n<td>密钥泄露，安全风险</td>\n<td>历史重写 + 轮换密钥</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提交了大型二进制文件</td>\n<td>仓库体积膨胀，克隆缓慢</td>\n<td>历史重写 + Git LFS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误的作者信息</td>\n<td>贡献统计不准确</td>\n<td>历史重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要拆分仓库</td>\n<td>Monorepo 拆分为多个独立仓库</td>\n<td>filter-repo</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>历史重写是把已提交的内容从历史中彻底移除，因此核心概念都围绕&quot;如何安全地做破坏性操作&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容重写</td>\n<td>把敏感数据或大文件从全部历史中剔除</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>filter-repo</td>\n<td>Git 官方推荐的通用重写工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BFG</td>\n<td>专注大文件与敏感数据的清理工具</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>镜像克隆</td>\n<td>用 --mirror 在工作副本上重写后再推送</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>善后</td>\n<td>重写后必须 expire、gc 并通知协作者重同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-filter-repo-推荐\">git filter-repo（推荐）</h2><p><strong>git-filter-repo</strong> 是 Git 官方推荐的历史重写工具，替代已废弃的 <code>git filter-branch</code>。它使用 Python 实现，速度比 filter-branch 快 10-100 倍。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install git-filter-repo&#10;&#10;git filter-repo --analyze&#10;cat .git/filter-repo/analysis/path-all-sizes.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> git-filter-repo</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --analyze</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cat</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .git/filter-repo/analysis/path-all-sizes.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>删除敏感文件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git filter-repo --invert-paths --path secrets.env&#10;&#10;git filter-repo --invert-paths --path-glob &#39;*.pem&#39;&#10;&#10;git filter-repo --invert-paths --path config/credentials/ --path .env\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --invert-paths</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secrets.env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --invert-paths</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path-glob</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '*.pem'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --invert-paths</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config/credentials/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --path</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span></code></pre></div><p>按文件大小过滤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git filter-repo --strip-blobs-bigger-than 10M\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --strip-blobs-bigger-than</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 10M</span></span></code></pre></div><p>修改作者信息：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git filter-repo --mailmap mailmap.txt\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-repo</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --mailmap</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mailmap.txt</span></span></code></pre></div><p>mailmap 文件格式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"New Name &lt;new@email.com&gt; &lt;old@email.com&gt;&#10;New Name &lt;new@email.com&gt; Old Name &lt;old@email.com&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">new@email.co</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">old@email.co</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">New</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">new@email.co</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Old</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> Name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">old@email.co</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>git filter-repo</code> 要求在干净的克隆仓库上操作。先用 <code>git clone --mirror</code> 创建镜像副本，在副本上执行重写，确认无误后再推送。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"git-filter-branch-已废弃\">git filter-branch（已废弃）</h2><p>虽然已被官方废弃，了解其语法有助于理解旧脚本：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git filter-branch --force --index-filter \\&#10;  &#39;git rm --cached --ignore-unmatch secrets.env&#39; \\&#10;  --prune-empty --tag-name-filter cat -- --all\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> filter-branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --index-filter</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'git rm --cached --ignore-unmatch secrets.env'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  --prune-empty</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tag-name-filter</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> cat</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>filter-repo</th>\n<th>filter-branch</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态</td>\n<td>推荐使用</td>\n<td>已废弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>快 10-100 倍</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>更安全的默认行为</td>\n<td>需要手动处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>依赖</td>\n<td>Python</td>\n<td>bash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>维护</td>\n<td>活跃维护</td>\n<td>不再更新</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"bfg-repo-cleaner\">BFG Repo-Cleaner</h2><p><strong>BFG</strong> 是专门用于清理大文件和敏感数据的工具，使用 Java 编写，操作简单直观：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"java -jar bfg.jar --delete-files secrets.env repo.git&#10;&#10;java -jar bfg.jar --strip-blobs-bigger-than 50M repo.git&#10;&#10;java -jar bfg.jar --replace-text passwords.txt repo.git\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfg.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --delete-files</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> secrets.env</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfg.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --strip-blobs-bigger-than</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 50M</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfg.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --replace-text</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> passwords.txt</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo.git</span></span></code></pre></div><p>BFG 工作流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git clone --mirror https://github.com/user/repo.git&#10;java -jar bfg.jar --strip-blobs-bigger-than 100M repo.git&#10;cd repo.git&#10;git reflog expire --expire=now --all&#10;git gc --prune=now --aggressive&#10;git push --force\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --mirror</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/user/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">java</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -jar</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> bfg.jar</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --strip-blobs-bigger-than</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 100M</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">cd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> expire</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --expire=now</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prune=now</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --aggressive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[clone --mirror] --&gt; B[BFG 清理]&#10;    B --&gt; C[reflog expire]&#10;    C --&gt; D[gc --prune]&#10;    D --&gt; E[push --force]\">graph LR\n    A[clone --mirror] --&gt; B[BFG 清理]\n    B --&gt; C[reflog expire]\n    C --&gt; D[gc --prune]\n    D --&gt; E[push --force]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>BFG</th>\n<th>filter-repo</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>专注领域</td>\n<td>大文件/敏感数据</td>\n<td>通用历史重写</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>使用难度</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保护</td>\n<td>默认保护 HEAD</td>\n<td>可配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"重写后的善后工作\">重写后的善后工作</h2><p>历史重写后必须执行以下步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git reflog expire --expire=now --all&#10;git gc --prune=now --aggressive&#10;&#10;git push origin --force --all&#10;git push origin --force --tags\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reflog</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> expire</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --expire=now</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gc</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prune=now</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --aggressive</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tags</span></span></code></pre></div><p>通知所有协作者：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 协作者需要执行&#10;git fetch origin&#10;git reset --hard origin/main&#10;&#10;# 或重新克隆&#10;git clone &lt;repo-url&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 协作者需要执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> reset</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --hard</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或重新克隆</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> clone</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">repo-ur</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 历史重写是<strong>不可逆的破坏性操作</strong>。务必在操作前备份仓库，通知所有协作者，并在重写后强制所有人重新同步。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"预防措施\">预防措施</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>措施</th>\n<th>工具/方法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pre-commit 检测</td>\n<td>gitleaks、detect-secrets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>.gitignore 配置</td>\n<td>排除 .env、<em>.pem、</em>.key 等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Git Hooks</td>\n<td>pre-commit hook 扫描敏感信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GitHub Secret Scanning</td>\n<td>GitHub 自动扫描已知密钥模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大文件管理</td>\n<td>Git LFS 追踪二进制文件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"brew install gitleaks&#10;gitleaks detect --source . --verbose&#10;&#10;echo &quot;*.env&quot; &gt;&gt; .gitignore&#10;echo &quot;*.pem&quot; &gt;&gt; .gitignore&#10;echo &quot;*.key&quot; &gt;&gt; .gitignore\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">brew</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> gitleaks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">gitleaks</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> detect</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --source</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.env\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.pem\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitignore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"*.key\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .gitignore</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((历史重写))&#10;    filter-repo&#10;      官方推荐&#10;      快速安全&#10;      通用重写&#10;    BFG&#10;      大文件清理&#10;      敏感数据&#10;      简单易用&#10;    filter-branch&#10;      已废弃&#10;      了解即可&#10;    善后工作&#10;      gc prune&#10;      force push&#10;      通知协作者&#10;    预防&#10;      gitleaks&#10;      .gitignore&#10;      pre-commit\">mindmap\n  root((历史重写))\n    filter-repo\n      官方推荐\n      快速安全\n      通用重写\n    BFG\n      大文件清理\n      敏感数据\n      简单易用\n    filter-branch\n      已废弃\n      了解即可\n    善后工作\n      gc prune\n      force push\n      通知协作者\n    预防\n      gitleaks\n      .gitignore\n      pre-commit</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>git filter-repo</strong> 是官方推荐的历史重写工具，速度快、安全性高、功能全面</li>\n<li><strong>BFG Repo-Cleaner</strong> 专注于大文件和敏感数据清理，操作简单直观</li>\n<li><strong>filter-branch</strong> 已废弃，新项目不应再使用</li>\n<li>历史重写后必须执行 <strong>gc prune</strong> 和 <strong>force push</strong>，并通知所有协作者重新同步</li>\n<li><strong>预防胜于治疗</strong>：使用 gitleaks、.gitignore 和 pre-commit hook 从源头杜绝敏感数据入库</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"历史重写","id":"历史重写"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要重写历史","id":"为什么需要重写历史"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"git filter-repo（推荐）","id":"git-filter-repo-推荐"},{"level":2,"text":"git filter-branch（已废弃）","id":"git-filter-branch-已废弃"},{"level":2,"text":"BFG Repo-Cleaner","id":"bfg-repo-cleaner"},{"level":2,"text":"重写后的善后工作","id":"重写后的善后工作"},{"level":2,"text":"预防措施","id":"预防措施"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"精选与回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/cherry-pick-and-revert"},"next":{"title":"远程与拉取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/remote-and-fetch"}}